# U-Boot console, after a matching Modular-kit U-Boot boot.
# Attach a USB device to the kit's HPS USB data connector (not J2 UART).
# Requires CONFIG_CMD_USB, the matching host controller/PHY and power routing.
usb start
usb tree
usb info
usb storage
# Optional: list a FAT filesystem on the first enumerated USB disk.
# fatls usb 0:1 /
